{"t":"FFIV","made":"2026-11-28 02:27","name":"F5, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":6632,"hq":"Seattle, WA, United States","website":"https://www.f5.com","summary_en":"F5, Inc. provides multi-cloud application security and delivery solutions in the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific region. The company's distributed cloud services enable its customers to deploy, secure, and operate applications in architecture, from on-premises to the public cloud. It also offers unified, security, networking, and application management solutions, such as web app and API protection; multi-cloud networking; application delivery and deployment; domain name system; content delivery network; and application deployment and orchestration. In addition, the company provides application security and delivery products, including NGINX Plus; NGINX One Console; NGINX Ingress Controller; WAF for NGINX; BIG-IP Packaged Software; and BIG-IP Systems. Further, it provides a range of professional services, including maintenance, consulting, training, and other technical support services. The company sells its products to large enterprise businesses, public sector institutions, governments, and service providers through distributors, value-added resellers, managed service providers, systems integrators, and other indirect channel partners. It has partnerships with public cloud providers, such as Amazon Web Services, Microsoft Azure, and Google Cloud Platform. The company was formerly known as F5 Networks, Inc. and changed its name to F5, Inc. in November 2021. F5, Inc. was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Seattle, Washington.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"F5, Inc.는 미국, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 및 아시아 태평양 지역에서 멀티 클라우드 애플리케이션 보안 및 전달 솔루션을 제공합니다. 회사의 분산형 클라우드 서비스를 통해 고객은 온프레미스에서 퍼블릭 클라우드에 이르기까지 아키텍처에서 애플리케이션을 배포, 보호 및 운영할 수 있습니다. 또한 웹 앱 및 API 보호와 같은 통합 보안, 네트워킹 및 애플리케이션 관리 솔루션을 제공합니다. 다중 클라우드 네트워킹; 애플리케이션 제공 및 배포; 도메인 이름 시스템; 콘텐츠 전달 네트워크; 애플리케이션 배포 및 오케스트레이션. 또한 회사는 NGINX Plus를 포함한 애플리케이션 보안 및 전달 제품을 제공합니다. NGINX 원 콘솔; NGINX 수신 컨트롤러; NGINX용 WAF; BIG-IP 패키지 소프트웨어; 및 BIG-IP 시스템. 또한 유지 관리, 컨설팅, 교육 및 기타 기술 지원 서비스를 포함한 다양한 전문 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사는 유통업체, 부가가치 리셀러, 관리 서비스 제공업체, 시스템 통합업체 및 기타 간접 채널 파트너를 통해 대기업, 공공 부문 기관, 정부 및 서비스 제공업체에 제품을 판매합니다. Amazon Web Services, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud Platform 등 퍼블릭 클라우드 제공업체와 파트너십을 맺고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 F5 Networks, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2021년 11월에 F5, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. F5, Inc.는 1996년에 법인화되었으며 워싱턴 주 시애틀에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":319.465,"mcap":18189086720.0,"pe":25.516373,"fpe":15.9113,"peg":1.2908,"ps":5.323632,"pb":4.531354,"ev_ebitda":18.125,"div":0.0,"beta":1.086,"hi52":483.3,"lo52":233.96},"fin":{"rev":3416668928.0,"rev_g":0.133,"eps_g":-0.01,"gross":0.81877,"op":0.24153,"net":0.21136,"roe":0.19011,"fcf":605018880.0,"cash":1590528000.0,"debt":245584992.0,"de":6.132,"eps":12.52,"feps":20.07787},"own":{"short":0.0291,"inst":0.98468,"insider":0.00612},"analyst":{"n":9,"mean":436.33334,"median":435.0,"high":540.0,"low":300.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.69231,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":1,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":1,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":2,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":448.0,"priorPriceTarget":415.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":540.0,"priorPriceTarget":525.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":428.0,"priorPriceTarget":397.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group",